<h2 style="color:#0b1f3d;margin-bottom:8px;">New message on your quote</h2>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Your sales representative has sent a message regarding quote <strong>{{refNumber}}</strong>:</p>
<blockquote style="border-left:4px solid #1e4d8c;padding:12px 16px;margin:16px 0;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:4px;color:#0b1f3d;">
  {{message}}
</blockquote>
<p>
  <a href="{{quoteUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1e4d8c;color:#fff;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">
    View your quote →
  </a>
</p>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-top:24px;">
  You can also reply directly to this email or log in to your account to respond.
</p>
